# TSBunShuffle core

Bun + Electrobun BizShuffle rewrite. Authoritative product spec: `docs/SPEC.md`.

## Package layout

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `@bizshuffle-bun/protocol` | Effect Schema types, WS codec, shared constants |
| `@bizshuffle-bun/domain` | Pure session logic — **no I/O** |
| `@bizshuffle-bun/server-host` | HTTP/WS server, persistence, game modes |
| `@bizshuffle-bun/client-host` | Player runtime, BizHawk IPC, WS client |
| `@bizshuffle-bun/admin-ui` | React admin SPA → `server-host/priv/static` (React Compiler; see `admin-ui-react-compiler` rule) |
| `@bizshuffle-bun/testing` | Contract, e2e, integration, arch tests |

Apps: `apps/server` (headless), `apps/desktop` (Electrobun), `apps/client-cli`.

## Quality gates (run before finishing)

```bash
bun run typecheck
bun run lint
bun run format:check
bun test
```

CI runs all of the above plus `build:admin`.

## Change discipline

- Minimize scope; match existing patterns in the touched package.
- Do not add docs/README unless asked.
- Do not commit unless the user asks.
- Prefer extending existing modules over new abstractions.
